# Stable spec ID: difford-bamboo. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(sherry; fino @ Lustau Jarana) 2 fl oz
(vermouth; amber) 1/3 fl oz
(vermouth; blanc @ Strucchi Bianco) 1/3 fl oz
(bitters; orange @ Angostura) 2 dashes

::equipment
(mixing vessel) = (mixing glass) -OR- (cocktail shaker)
(cocktail glass, Nick & Nora)

::instructions
[
  <pour, measured ingredients repeatedly between mixing vessels from height with ice retained in one vessel; the source calls this throwing>
]
-OR-
[
  <stir, measured ingredients with ice in (mixing glass)>
]
<strain, into chilled (cocktail glass, Nick & Nora)>
<express citrus oil, from orange zest over the drink>
<garnish, with the zest>

::notes
This records one source-specific version; no universal formula or automatic product substitution is implied.
The current page uses amber and blanc vermouth; do not silently replace them with dry vermouth. Throwing is a source-permitted method; stirring is the simpler alternative.

